{"audio":"gn/unknown/gn_u_26354878.mp3","text":"Chopombe ndaje imitã guive oñangarekova'ekue Ña Antonia-re."}
{"audio":"gn/unknown/gn_u_32418256.mp3","text":"Techakuaa chupe iñasãi opaite hendápe."}
{"audio":"gn/unknown/gn_u_26587350.mp3","text":"Oréko oreresãi ha rovy'a amo roimehápe."}
{"audio":"gn/unknown/gn_u_33893491.mp3","text":"Upévare avei Ñandejára ipochy orendive."}
{"audio":"gn/unknown/gn_u_26498006.mp3","text":"Sapy'apy'a ojejuhu upépe Pláta Yvyguy."}
{"audio":"gn/unknown/gn_u_26548045.mp3","text":"ohasaporãta upe ary"}
{"audio":"gn/unknown/gn_u_32074629.mp3","text":"Teroñe'ẽje'éva pypegua."}
{"audio":"gn/unknown/gn_u_26586941.mp3","text":"Ha'e oñangareko ogapýre."}
{"audio":"gn/unknown/gn_u_32418540.mp3","text":"Ou ha oho ñaimo'ã yvytu mba'e."}
{"audio":"gn/unknown/gn_u_34352353.mp3","text":"Anivéna ere upéicha che irũ"}
{"audio":"gn/unknown/gn_u_34152306.mp3","text":"Tava'i oĩva Ka'asapápe."}
{"audio":"gn/unknown/gn_u_26407641.mp3","text":"Hetáma aha'ãrõ ha nderejúi gueteri."}
